{"id":"n62742-3-7","stage":3,"title":"미치다 · 疯","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62742-3-7-1","ko":"아이한테 그렇게 소리를 지르면 아이가 놀라잖아.","zh":"对孩子那么大喊的话，孩子会受惊的啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아이한테","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소리를","meaning":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","explanation":"소리：嗓音，嗓子，嗓门；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"소리","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62379","senseId":"3","lemma":"소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지르면","meaning":"喊叫","explanation":"지르다：喊叫；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"지르다","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62312","senseId":"1","lemma":"지르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아이가","meaning":"小孩，孩子","explanation":"아이：小孩，孩子；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"1","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"놀라잖아.","meaning":"惊吓，吃惊","explanation":"놀라다：惊吓，吃惊；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"놀라다","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61607","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀라다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"小孩，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"年纪小的人。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"d13cec79f66edb6a","term":"소리","zh":"嗓音，嗓子，嗓门","audio":"/audio/d13cec79f66edb6aa0c5.mp3","entryId":"62379","definition":"从人的喉咙发出的声音。","pronunciation":["소리"]},{"id":"987e83fdad67159d","term":"지르다","zh":"喊叫","audio":"/audio/987e83fdad67159dfb76.mp3","entryId":"62312","definition":"放开嗓音大叫。","pronunciation":["지르다"]},{"id":"ca0d0655d175ea6c","term":"놀라다","zh":"惊吓，吃惊","audio":"/audio/ca0d0655d175ea6cd75b.mp3","entryId":"61607","definition":"因遭到意外或害怕而在刹那间感到紧张或心跳加速。","pronunciation":["놀ː라다"]}],"audio":"/audio/84c59ed3ad04481d55f1.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62742-3-7-2","ko":"화가 나서 미칠 것 같아서 그랬어.","zh":"是因为太生气了，快疯了才那样做的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"화가","meaning":"火，气","explanation":"화：火，气；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"화","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74134","senseId":"1","lemma":"화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나서","meaning":"发火（화이/가 나다）","explanation":"나다：发火（화이/가 나다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"12","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"미칠","meaning":"疯","explanation":"미치다：疯；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"미치다","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62742","senseId":"3","lemma":"미치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아서","meaning":"要是，如果是","explanation":"같다：要是，如果是；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"4","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그랬어.","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"950afe85bf406364","term":"화","zh":"火，气","audio":"/audio/950afe85bf406364ecdd.mp3","entryId":"74134","definition":"十分不满意或恼怒的情绪。","pronunciation":["화ː"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发火（화이/가 나다）","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"发火（화이/가 나다）","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"80cc63abcc13a410","term":"미치다","zh":"疯","audio":"/audio/80cc63abcc13a4106e78.mp3","entryId":"62742","definition":"由于某个状态非常严重，像精神将要跨掉一样感到痛苦。","pronunciation":["미치다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"要是，如果是","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"表示“如果在某种状况或条件下”。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]}],"audio":"/audio/1513c41c7d0dfd07f827.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62742","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":92,"sequenceScore":2.4834,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是因为太生气了，快疯了才那样做的。","对孩子那么大喊的话，孩子会受惊的啊。","我在这里找到了火柴！"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["对孩子那么大喊的话，孩子会受惊的啊。","我在这里找到了火柴！","是因为太生气了，快疯了才那样做的。"],"answer":2}]}
